 ## Overview
-Object manipulation allows users to alter 3D data geometry or orientation, such as changing a model's curvature, to support inter-user understanding in collaborative settings [S1]. It differs from [Ray-based Picking](19665-ray-based-picking.md) by directly modifying scene state via face dragging rather than merely selecting data, and from [Tangible Dataset Manipulation](#tangible-dataset-manipulation) by using depth rays and standard input devices instead of physical reference objects.
